{'symbol': 'CMI', 'date': '2023-01-23 08:30:00', 'title': 'VICE PRESIDENT AMY BOERGER RETIRING AFTER 39 YEARS WITH CUMMINS', 'text': 'COLUMBUS, IND.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--TODAY, CUMMINS INC. (NYSE: CMI) ANNOUNCED THAT AFTER 39 YEARS WITH THE COMPANY, AMY BOERGER, VICE PRESIDENT AND GENERAL MANAGER – NORTH AMERICA ON-HIGHWAY, WILL RETIRE AT THE END OF MARCH 2023. WITH THE ANNOUNCEMENT OF HER RETIREMENT, JOSÉ SAMPERIO, WILL ASSUME THE ROLE OF EXECUTIVE DIRECTOR AND GENERAL MANAGER – NORTH AMERICA ON-HIGHWAY.'}